# Graphiti 上游源码的本地参考 checkout（运行时用 pip 安装的 graphiti_core，不入库）
graphiti-0.29.2/

# Docker 数据
data/

# DeerFlow 2.0 research/agent engine — assembled into ./deer-flow by ./setup.sh
# (seeded from the vendored RC below, or a pinned upstream clone, + bridge
# overlay; the built runtime carries a ~900MB venv and is never committed).
deer-flow/
# Vendored DeerFlow 2.0 source drop (the exact build the bridge targets). It is
# the preferred seed for ./setup.sh but is a large third-party tree, so it is
# kept local-only rather than committed. Drop a newer deer-flow-2.0-* here to
# pin a different build.
deer-flow-2.0-m1-rc3/
deer-flow-2.0-*/
# 当前的 vendored DeerFlow 2.0 正式版源码（setup.sh DEERFLOW_VENDOR_DIR 默认指向此处；
# 大体量第三方源码树，保持 local-only 不入库）
deer-flow-2.0.0/

# Local agent/session artifacts (never commit)
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
handoff.md

# Foglamp codebase scan state (the lock file contains a private edit token)
.foglamp/
# linear-engine / search-tool runtime caches
deerflow_bridge/.cache/
